      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8858596a7d387e87",
      "translationZh": "我们正在为 Claude Code 添加对 AGENTS.md 的支持。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fdf571174e644d92",
      "translationZh": "从今天的 2.1.277 版本开始，如果某个文件夹中没有 CLAUDE.md，Claude 就会检查是否存在 AGENTS.md，并使用它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c986c54b07a49166",
      "translationZh": "对 AGENTS.md 的支持基于 Claude Code mods 构建，这是我们即将推出的一种定制 Claude Code 运行框架的方式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "82311a99d834252f",
      "translationZh": "这是一个内置 mod，不过你也可以根据自己的需要，自行构建自定义版本的项目指令。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d7a3bc2803a8c8be",
      "translationZh": "你可以在这里查看这个 mod 的源代码！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4be3ad13605b4c88",
      "translationZh": "—— Thariq Shihipar，这里还有更多 mods",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
